@0    = ~Unofficial Item Pack~


@1    = ~This wardstone is a virtual area of darkness and seems to suck the very light from space around it. The shape of the stone is hard to discern, cloaked in shadow as it is. If it is used as an ioun stone, shadow entirely covers the wearer and protects from attacks from even the most ferocious creatures of darkness.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Negative Plane Protection

Weight: 1~


@2    = ~The three holy symbols connected to form this disc, the Symbol of Amaunator. Still contains remnants of the lost power god of the sun, which can be used to generate Sunray once per day.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
- Sunray once per day

Weight: 1~


@3    = ~This is the reconstructed mask of King Strohm the Third. When you place it on your face, the entire world becomes tinted with odd colors. The mask allows the wearer to see things as they really are.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
- True Sight once per day

Equipped abilities:
- Armor Class: +1

Weight: 1~


@4    = ~This is a well-crafted locket, obviously made with care, and typical of keepsake items often given to loved ones. A minor enchantment has attempted to capture the likeness of both <CHARNAME> and Jaheira within, making it a thoughtful gift of remembrance. One side has suffered some smudging, but it is a sweet gift nonetheless. If Jaheira wears the locket around her neck, then she looks much more relaxed.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Hit Points: +5
– Charisma: +1
- Armor Class: +1

Weight: 1~

@5    = ~These are the gems in which the lich Deirex stores the imprisoned souls of his enemies. A truly evil person could try to suck out the vitality of the imprisoned drow warriors. However, it requires a great mental focus, so the user will not be able to cast spells.

Charge abilities:
- Tenser's Transformation once per day

STATISTICS:

Weight: 1~

@9    = ~Woven by the finest of drow craftsmen, this mail feels more akin to cloth than to metal. The armor may be worn by Thieves with few penalties and by Fighter/Mages without removing their spellcasting ability.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Open Locks: -5%
– Find Traps: -5%
– Pick Pockets: -20%
– Move Silently: -10%
– Spellcasting is not disabled

Armor Class: 3 (1 vs. slashing, 5 vs. crushing)
Requires:
5 Strength

Weight: 8~

@10    = ~This holy sigil of the god Tyr signifies that the holder is an agent of his justice and has permission to carry out judgment against those deemed wicked in his eyes..

Anyone who wears this powerful amulet is protected against evil, and his mind is always clear.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Protection from evil
– Immunity to charm
– Immunity to confusion

Weight: 0~

@11    = ~Gripping this talisman tightly will cause the user to be immediately whisked away via magical means to a predefined location. This particular Talisman of the Hearthfire has been constructed to bring the user to a hidden forest refuge within Amn.

Wild Magic provides much more power than is needed, so the talisman can be used even for fast transfers over short distances.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
- Dimension Door thrice per day

Weight: 1~

@12    = ~A golden circlet found within the sealed tomb in Trademeet's cemetery. The circlet is tarnished with age but one can still make out Waukeen's symbol on the circlet and feel the blessings of the golden lady.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- Charisma: +2
- Wearer is under the effects of the Luck spell

Weight: 1~

@13    = ~This is the crystal shard obtained from the avatar of Kurtulmak whose essence was trapped within a large crystal. The kobolds seemed to worship it.

It looks like the magical powers of the crystal shard can be used to absorb enemy spells.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
- Ruby Ray of Reversal once per day

Weight: 18~

@15    = ~Leather armor +5: Human Flesh 

Made from human skin and treated with the blood of a noble dragon, this armor emits the stench of bitter death. The malevolent armor can only be used by a truly evil person.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Saving Throws: +4
– Magic Resistance: +20%
– Move Silently: +20%

Armor Class: 3 (5 vs. piercing and missile)
Requires:
3 Strength

Weight: 5~

