@101    = ~This figurine of wondrous power was last in the possession of Drizzt Do'Urden, who treated Guenhwyvar as his ranger animal companion. She can be summoned to her master's side for eight hours every day. However, it is possible for her to be away from the astral plane for longer, but this causes her to become incredibly drowsy, barely able to lift her head.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
– Summon Guenhwyvar once per day

Weight: 5~

