@106    = ~These magical hourglasses are considered as some of Gond's most powerful artifacts. Once per day, it is possible to use their hidden powers and temporarily stop time. This hourglass has long been in the possession of the Cowled Wizards who studied its power.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
– Time Stop once per day

Weight: 1~

@110    = ~Ring of superior arcane clumsiness~
@111    = ~Ring of superior arcane clumsiness~
@112    = ~It's hard to say whether is this ring a blessing or a curse. Although saved life to many wizards, a considerable number from them sooner or later died because of this ring. The ring acts as a conductor between astral plane, resulting in that any spell is cast almost immediately. Unfortunately, the direct connection with astral plane requires a tremendous amount of mental concentration and even a small distraction results in spell failure.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Spellcasting is instant
– Casting failure: 30%
– Armor Class: +1

Weight: 0~

@114    = ~Kangaxx's robe~
