@116    = ~This powerful robe was wore by ancient lich Kangaxx who figured out a way how bind his essence to this sphere and became immune to all forms of magical imprisonment. Part of this spell is still present in this robe, but the fabric is completely soaked by evil.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Armor Class: 3
– Magic Resistance: +10%
– Immunity to magical forms of imprisonment

Weight: 6~

